    },
    "summary": "When a unit picks **desperate escape** as its **Fall Back move** mode, its **hazard rolls** for that mode are what rules call its Desperate Escape test; an ability subtracting from that test subtracts from those rolls instead.\n\nA unit that a Stratagem or ability tells to take a Desperate Escape test:\n\n- picks desperate escape as its mode when selected for a Fall Back move\n- rolls 1 hazard roll for every model in it\n- takes a **battle-shock roll**",
